        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion P6, River Rock Sandcast Bronze Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis rustic looking handleset made by Fusion is made out of true bronze with over 90 percent copper content. Available in 3 finshes, it will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings. It features a thick, curved handle that only adds to its old world feel, making it an excellent choice for classically styled homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten Bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<Also Available <A href=\"/products/river-rock-two-piece-handleset-with-covered-deadbolt-fusion-p5\"><b>River Rock Bronze Handleset With Covered Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the River Rock Collection Bronze Handleset Fusion P6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True bronze product (sandcast and lost wax) with over 90% copper content.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching Latch, Strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual Spring Assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rustic Two Piece Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 10-3/4\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>One year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
